 "blocksHtml": "<div class=\"js-grid-slider mb-5 mb-10@sm overflow-hidden user-select-none\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center\" style=\"user-select: none;\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/4@sm mr-5 mr-8@sm flex-no-shrink pointer-events-none\">\n<div class=\"mb-2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n<div class=\"js-grid-slider-text\">\n<h2 animate-from=\"preset: 'fadeUp'\" class=\"mb-1 t-500 t-lh-1.1 t-uppercase t-ls-tight t-base\">Initial Exploration</h2>\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">A round up of our initial concept submissions with many elements from each direction making it into the final design. </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none js-slider-items\">\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(12%, 7%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"1\" dom2webgl=\"image20116113\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"/media/973bde77e12e.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-1%, 11%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-200\" dom2webgl=\"image6201948\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/7efd3a1bcfc6.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(6%, -14%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"150\" dom2webgl=\"image6096920\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/7b3be396a2b1.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-12%, 9%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image6197102\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/a59acedb919e.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-3%, 7%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"250\" dom2webgl=\"image6247731\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/f1b0a6002a32.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(13%, 10%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-15\" dom2webgl=\"image20076043\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/4d121bfa9a63.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-6%, -4%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"16\" dom2webgl=\"image20128281\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/4188b6099f9b.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-8%, 13%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-14\" dom2webgl=\"image2020657\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"/media/2354d0296a09.mp4\"></video></div></div><div class=\"d-flex\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(7%, -13%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-50\" dom2webgl=\"image6212101\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/3bfe4b4acb34.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(13%, -3%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"18\" dom2webgl=\"image20135473\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"/media/1b88d5e0a4a0.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-8%, -13%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-150\" dom2webgl=\"image610972\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/361fc052d5fc.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-1%, 7%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image6233347\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/6fbe3632b5e7.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(15%, 4%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-17\" dom2webgl=\"image20065547\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/03e3c65d6d4c.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-9%, 9%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image6074738\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/e03d2be85df7.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-14%, -9%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"0\" dom2webgl=\"image20163987\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"/media/75cebb9a46e7.mp4\"></video></div></div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image5546aaa7abf7f76f\" src=\"/media/31355fc3849e.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nWe created a contemporary new look for Lewa House, while carefully preserving its rustic and authentic charm<br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm offset-1/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThe full scope of this project involved a total rethink of the Lewa House identity and online presence. We worked closely with the Lewa House team to evolve their brand, maintaining the essence of what makes Lewa so special, whilst giving it a more contemporary feel in order to appeal to a wider audience. <br/>\n<br/>\nAlong with creating a new logo mark and introducing a more refined suite of typography, we carefully selected a new set of brand colours featuring warm and earthy tones, inspired by the vibrant Lewa landscape. This was supported by hand drawn elements to add to the rugged charm of the brand, which aimed to emulate the unique experience they offer as a travel destination. <br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image5566aaa7abf85ba0\" src=\"/media/e2fdd2461863.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image6046aaa7abf8a53c\" src=\"/media/40ec4226bbb2.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image5586aaa7abf8eb6f\" src=\"/media/f4966fceebd1.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image5616aaa7abf93901\" src=\"/media/41e5715a023e.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/7f1f11cb28df.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image562\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/554346c1c5b7.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image565\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nAn immersive storytelling experience that encourages users to explore the wonders Lewa has to offer<br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm offset-1/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nWe created an explorative journey for users to discover Lewa’s wonders in a nonlinear, organic way. The site still contains a more traditional navigation, allowing users to quickly access information if needed, but the main flow aims to lead users on an exciting, meandering path of discovery.<br/>\n<br/>\nGuided by Sophie, the lodge owner, users are taken on a journey of discovery; learning about Lewa’s history and deep connection to the wildlife they protect. Bringing Lewa’s story to life was our number one priority. We created a highly interactive narrative that ran through the site making use of purposeful animation, gamified features, and rich media.<br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<a class=\"btn btn--regular btn--fill btn--light js-btn\" data-btn=\"fill\" data-cursor=\"hide\" href=\"https://lewahouse.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner js-btn-inner\">\n<span class=\"btn__content js-btn-content\">\n<span class=\"d-flex flex-row items-end\">\n<span class=\"btn__text\">\nVisit Site \n</span>\n<svg class=\"btn__icon d-inline-block js-btn-icon\">\n<use xlink:href=\"/assets/images/img-687f48138f.svg#arrow\"></use>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/4fc1909c0b90.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1010\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container d-flex@sm items-center justify-center mb-5 mb-20@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm mb-6 mb-0@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: 30, rotationZ: 3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '30%' : 0 }, rotationY: 10, rotationZ: -3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"video\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<video data-src=\"/media/fabedad1b824.mp4\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: -30, rotationZ: -3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '-10%' : 0 }, rotationY: -10, rotationZ: 3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/5265001a6a44.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image6366aaa7abf9f7c0\" src=\"/media/1a5ea73686fd.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThe Lewa landscape brought to life through an immersive 3D experience<br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/2@sm offset-1/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThe interactive map sits at the epicentre of the journey, encouraging users to engage with the content on a deeper, more emotional level. Main page links are positioned among educational and informative content which can all be viewed without leaving the map. \n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<a class=\"btn btn--regular btn--fill btn--light js-btn\" data-btn=\"fill\" data-cursor=\"hide\" href=\"https://lewahouse.com/explore/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner js-btn-inner\">\n<span class=\"btn__content js-btn-content\">\n<span class=\"d-flex flex-row items-end\">\n<span class=\"btn__text\">\nExplore Map\n</span>\n<svg class=\"btn__icon d-inline-block js-btn-icon\">\n<use xlink:href=\"/assets/images/img-687f48138f.svg#arrow\"></use>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/3f3ebbb83278.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1107\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-3/4@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nGenerating the terrain\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-3/4@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThere were two main challenges when creating Lewa’s map. We first needed to create the 3D geometry of the land using limited topographic data, and next we needed to create an accurate texture for the terrain ensuring the plains, rivers and forest were all represented accurately. Satellite imagery of Lewa was basic, so we utilised Gaea world generator and Substance Painter to build on the data we did have and procedurally added detail to the geometry and texture. The map was then built in WebGL and uses the tiled 4k texture we created custom.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/0dd01823e48b.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1057\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image10276aaa7abfa5ffd\" src=\"/media/fdff6edf17b7.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image10266aaa7abfaa902\" src=\"/media/591c0ae48d44.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"preset: 'mobileWithText'\" class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-center mb-6 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"relative w-1/2\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--3/2 aspect--1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<video data-src=\"/media/31b33463fb6f.mp4\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/3@sm js-phone-start\">\n<div class=\"w-3/4@sm visible\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<h2 class=\"mb-1.5 t-1.5 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-normal\">Responsive </h2>\n<p class=\"t-lh-1.3 mb-0 js-mobile-caption\">\nWith mobile browsing dominating the tourism industry, particular attention was paid to perfecting performance and functionality on handheld devices.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center justify-center\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/3@sm js-phone-end\">\n<div class=\"w-3/4@sm visible\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<h2 class=\"mb-1.5 t-1.5 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-normal\">&amp; Immersive </h2>\n<p class=\"t-lh-1.3 ml-auto mb-0 js-mobile-caption\">\nEven on these devices the interactive map offers an immersive and memorable way to discover the unique experiences Lewa has to offer.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"relative w-1/2\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--3/2 aspect--1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"aspect__child\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11156aaa7abfaf651\" src=\"/media/2778de477517.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/904ec560124a.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image1016\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image11136aaa7abfb3feb\" src=\"/media/c9fc02cddfe7.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2we